# Development artifacts (anchored to root level)
# SMI-4396: /data/* instead of /data/ so the SMI-4396 allowlist negation below
# can re-include its one version-controlled file — gitignore forbids negating
# a child when the parent directory itself is excluded.
/data/*
!/data/skills-security-allowlist.json
# SMI-4408: indexer blocklist for non-skill repos (imported-skill ingest filter).
!/data/indexer-blocklist.json
# SMI-6441: vendored SecLists snapshot + hand-curated keeplist for the weak-
# password lexicon generator (scripts/gen-weak-password-lexicon.mjs). The
# directory itself must be un-ignored (not just its files) — see the SMI-4396
# comment above on why gitignore can't negate a child of an excluded parent.
!/data/wordlists/
/output/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/

# SMI-5668: NEEDLE-based Codex dispatch (maintainer-machine-only tooling).
# results/*.log is already covered by the blanket *.log rule above; these two
# are a defensive backstop against an accidental commit of NEEDLE's own
# bead-store SQLite/JSONL state or its per-bead traces from inside a worktree.
scripts/needle/results/
.beads/

